        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lee Unkrich, Robert Stevenson, Walt Disney, Sherman Brothers\n- Companies: Pixar Animation Studios, Walt Disney Pictures\n- Products: Monsters, Inc., Mary Poppins, Finding Nemo, Toy Story 3\n- Topics: film production, film direction, animation, awards\n\nFacts:\n- Mary Poppins is a 1964 American musical-fantasy film directed by Robert Stevenson and produced by Walt Disney.\n- The Sherman Brothers wrote and composed the songs for Mary Poppins.\n- Monsters, Inc. is a 2001 American computer-animated comedy film produced by Pixar Animation Studios and distributed by Walt Disney Pictures.\n- Lee Unkrich co-directed Monsters, Inc. and Finding Nemo before making his solo directorial debut with Toy Story 3.\n- Lee Unkrich won the 2011 Academy Award for Best Animated Film for Toy Story 3.",
